flowchart BT
  E["<b>DynamicInferenceEngine</b> · Megatron-LM<br/>1 per GPU · runs the model, holds the KV cache"]
  W["<b>MegatronPolicyWorker</b> · NeMo RL Ray actor<br/>1 per GPU · owns the engine, receives weights, pause / suspend / resume hooks"]
  G["<b>MegatronGeneration</b> (per role) · NeMo RL<br/>TP×PP workers = one complete copy · one per Dynamo worker<br/>per-role TP/PP layout, RefitMembership offset"]
  POOL["<b>MegatronDynamoWorkerPool</b> · NeMo RL<br/>starts the per-role copies in refit-rank order, refit fan-out,<br/>ordered pause + pin drain, ordered shutdown"]
  DG["<b>DynamoGeneration</b> · NeMo RL<br/>the frontend's client · posts rollouts, waits for idle rollouts before a refit"]
  RT["<b>ManagedDynamoRuntime</b> · NeMo RL<br/>etcd + NATS + frontend · owns the pool · readiness per role"]
  C["<b>Coordinator</b> · Megatron-LM<br/>1 per copy · started by rank 0"]
  I["<b>InferenceClient</b> · Megatron-LM<br/>adapter's and the pool's connection to the coordinator"]
  A["<b>Megatron adapter</b> (MegatronLLMEngine) · Megatron-LM code<br/>hosted by a dynamo.common.backend.Worker task<br/>on rank 0's actor loop · no sidecar"]
  F["<b>Dynamo frontend</b> · prefill router<br/>picks a prefill and a decode worker"]
  E -- "lives inside" --> W
  W -- "TP×PP of them form" --> G
  G -- "N per-role copies" --> POOL
  G -- "rank 0 starts" --> C
  I -- "connects to" --> C
  A -- "uses" --> I
  W -- "rank 0 hosts" --> A
  POOL -- "owned by" --> RT
  RT -- "started by" --> DG
  RT -- "owns" --> F
  DG -- "HTTP requests" --> F
  A -- "registers prefill-0 / decode-0 with" --> F
